{"name": "The Factory Must Fall", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"204\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970860/extras/5843568d76e08060f73e22bc45982754.poster.avif?t=1794579859\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970860/extras/5843568d76e08060f73e22bc45982754.webm?t=1794579859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970860/extras/5843568d76e08060f73e22bc45982754.mp4?t=1794579859\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Draft buildings from a random shop, design your factory and optimize resource allocation. Take all the time you want -Once you are ready, launch your design into battle with another player!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build your Battle Factory!\u00a0Grow your Battle Factory!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970860/extras/f37de87d16633a5219a2c54add1930a2.poster.avif?t=1794579859\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970860/extras/f37de87d16633a5219a2c54add1930a2.webm?t=1794579859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970860/extras/f37de87d16633a5219a2c54add1930a2.mp4?t=1794579859\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Setup production lines to create auto-attacking units</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Draft buildings from a shop and grow your factory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage power and resource allocation and decide the unit composition of your army</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start the battle when you are ready - watch your strategy unfold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Next round, grow and adapt your factory</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fight your friends! Climb the ladder!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"524\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970860/extras/5a0e6f0eef2d3575a3e8a2f14502bd46.poster.avif?t=1794579859\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970860/extras/5a0e6f0eef2d3575a3e8a2f14502bd46.webm?t=1794579859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970860/extras/5a0e6f0eef2d3575a3e8a2f14502bd46.mp4?t=1794579859\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face the builds of real, equally skilled human opponents on the ranked ladder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb the ranks as you gain League Points (LP) and reach the top of the leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge your friends directly in a private match</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Endless build possibilities!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970860/extras/6e7ffbeb29d5baaa4b3a546425ac63b7.poster.avif?t=1794579859\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970860/extras/6e7ffbeb29d5baaa4b3a546425ac63b7.webm?t=1794579859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://sha